uality and reliability, but communication issues and egocentric attitude may be problematic. So we can argue that while C shows strong decision quality under pressure, his communication difficulties and egocentric behavior could impair crew cooperation, which is critical. Therefore B remains preferred, but we need to discuss further. So produce public message: I acknowledge James's evidence, compare C vs B, note that C's decision quality is strong but communication concerns outweigh. Keep vote B.\n\nNow produce METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate B."}
